    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d273-a10">

                <pb facs="0502" n="440" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg440"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 10 in No.
                    40.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Carrié to the British minister.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Office of the
                            Secretary of State of the Department of Foreign
                                Affairs</hi>,<lb/><placeName><hi rendition="#italic">Port au
                                Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-sibling-dates" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1878-03-16T23:59:59-04:49"
                            notBefore="1878-03-15T00:00:00-04:49"><hi rendition="#italic">le </hi>
                            ———, 187–</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister</hi>: I have taken note of the verbal
                    communication you made to me concerning the demand of General Tanis, who desires
                    an interview with the corps diplomatique.</p>
                <pb facs="0503" n="441" xml:id="pg441"/>
                <p>The government regrets that at this stage of military operations against the
                    rebels it cannot allow, at present, any suspension of hostilities.</p>
                <p>I have the honor, Mr. Minister, to salute you with the highest consideration.</p>
                <closer><signed><list>
                            <item>F. CARRIÉ.</item>
                            <item>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stuart</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Minister Resident of Her Britannia Majesty’s
                                    Government in Hayti.</hi></item>
                        </list></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
